version 0.18.0
component dc-005-a200

# Xun Pu's DC-005-A200: a 2.0 mm right-angle through-hole DC jack with a switched sleeve contact.
# The vendor's own page states 2 A / 30 V DC; the vendor's own drawing states 30 V DC / 3 A. The
# lower number is used here: the page is the vendor's product statement, the drawing is not a
# newer statement of the rating, and a design must not sit on the higher of two numbers the
# vendor publishes for one part. The difference is written down in docs/datasheets.md.

kind         part
mpn          DC-005-A200
manufacturer Xun Pu
category     connector
datasheet    https://www.xunpu.com.cn/product/458.html
lcsc         C720557
description  Right-angle 2.0 mm DC power jack with switched sleeve contact, 2 A / 30 V DC
symbol       connectors:dc-jack-th
footprint    connector:dc-jack-th
positive_pin 1

# The drawing's pin table: the plug is 2.0 mm (DC-005-A200; the 2.5 mm variant is DC-005-A250),
# and the electrical circuit gives 4 = tip, 3 = switch, 2 = sleeve. The project's pin numbers are
# its own: 1 = tip, 2 = sleeve, 3 = switch.
pins
  1  TIP     polarized
  2  SLEEVE  polarized
  3  SWITCH  passive

ratings
  value         length  2.0mm
  rated_current current 2A
  voltage       voltage 30V
